      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait that's actually insane. 106 vs 112 is basically the same thing when you consider atmospheric interference, right? if the city is the antenna, does that mean the certain buildings were placed there to act as amplifiers or reflectors? like the cathedral or the ministry buildings? look at their shapes and tell me if they fit the pattern for signal focusing.",
